<%= club.name %>, <%= round.label.downcase %>
<%= "=" * (club.name.length + round.label.length + 2) %>

<% if club.watchlist_mode? -%>
<%= candidates.size %> films, picked from what <%= member_count %> of us have on our watchlists.
<% else -%>
<%= candidates.size %> films from the club's list that none of the <%= member_count %> of us have watched.
<% end %>
<% candidates.each_with_index do |(cand, film), i| -%>
  <%= i + 1 %>. <%= film.display %><% if club.watchlist_mode? %> — <%= cand.match_count %> of us want it<% end %>
<% end -%>

Rank them here:
<%= club_url %>

There's no deadline. The round stays open until everyone has voted, and the
film with the most points wins the moment the last ballot lands.
<% unless stale.empty? -%>

<% if club.watchlist_mode? -%>
Heads up: we couldn't refresh <%= stale.join(", ") %>'s watchlist recently, so this ballot may be out of date.
<% else -%>
Heads up: we don't know yet what <%= stale.join(", ") %> <%= stale.size == 1 ? "has" : "have" %> watched,
so this ballot may include films they've already seen.
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

